  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **BIT / 96 KHZ Fileset**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **Remember You Love In My Prayers**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n- **Mary**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **My Sweet Blue-Eyed Darlin**: rare: 5 archived performances [6]\n- **Body & Soul**: rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.akg414.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 126 min [1]\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac24**: source not stated; 19 songs; 126 min [2]\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: source not stated; 19 songs; 126 min [3]\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.akg414.flac16**: source not stated; 19 songs; 126 min [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Andy Lytle is credited with making the sound good in the lobby; the taper also wished Keith Richards a 75th birthday [1]\n- Andy Lytle is credited with making the lobby sound great; taper also marked Keith Richards' 75th birthday [2]\n- Andy Lytle is credited with making the lobby sound great; taper also noted Keith Richards turning 75 [3]\n- Andy Lytle is credited with making the lobby sound great; taper also noted Keith Richards' 75th birthday [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.akg414.flac24**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: AKG C414's>Sound Devices MixPre-6 [1]. Also: Recorded and processed by Keith Litzenberger using AKG C414 XLS microphones in subcardioid pattern, into a Sound Devices MixPre-6 at 24/96; The reviewer noted the upload of this AKG 24-bit FLAC set appeared very quickly [1][5]\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac24**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41v's>KCY>VST62iu>SDMP6 [2]. Also: Keith Litzenberger recorded with Schoeps MK41v mics through KCY 250/5i and VST62iu preamp stages into a MixPre-6 at 24/96 [2]\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.schoepsMK41v.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY 250/5i>Schoeps VST62iu>Sound Devices MixPre-6 [3]. Also: Schoeps MK41v mics through KCY 250/5i and VST62iu into MixPre-6 at 24/96; converted to 16-bit/44.1kHz with iZotope tools, then FLAC [3]\n- **billystrings2018-12-18.litz.akg414.flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Keith Litzenberger; source: AKG 414 XLS's (Subcardioid)>Sound Devices MixPre-6 [4]. Also: AKG C414 XLS mics in subcardioid into MixPre-6 at 24/96; downconverted to 16-bit/44.1kHz via iZotope, then FLAC. Taped by Keith Litzenberger [4]",
